  "independent_finding": {
    "reviewer": "/root/tdm_audit_a_g",
    "problem": "Native grants used origin None, so two independent once-per-turn abilities, or a native granted and printed ability at the same index, shared TriggerUse history."
  },
  "repair": [
    "Use Some(timestamp) for each acquired ability in grant_source_permanent_trigger, grant_temporary_ability_to and evolve_source. mayhem already uses that identity.",
    "Global checked role timestamps distinguish acquisitions; the exact recipient is a separate history key, so one grant to several recipients remains independent. Existing availability timestamps, copied queued origins and modal-history retention are reused.",
    "No field or hot-state allocation was added. Existing optional origin fields now serialize for native grants; affected observation/trace values remain part of the pending global schema/trace checkpoint."
  ],
